<%- include('partials/head') %><div class="auth-page"><section class="auth-visual"><div class="auth-visual-inner"><div class="brand-pill"><i class="bi bi-graph-up-arrow"></i> Finance Manager</div><h1>Finanzen. Klar.<br>Unter Kontrolle.</h1><p>Private und geschäftliche Finanzen in einer sicheren, lokalen Übersicht.</p><div class="feature-list"><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> PostgreSQL</span><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Lokale Datenhaltung</span><span><i class="bi bi-check-circle-fill"></i> Audit-Log</span></div></div></section><section class="auth-form-side"><div class="auth-card-modern"><div class="mb-4"><span class="eyebrow">Willkommen zurück</span><h2>Anmelden</h2><p class="text-secondary">Melde dich an, um deine Finanzübersicht zu öffnen.</p></div><% if(error){%><div class="alert alert-danger"><i class="bi bi-exclamation-circle me-2"></i><%= error %></div><%}%><form method="post" class="vstack gap-3"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><div><label class="form-label">Benutzername oder E-Mail</label><input class="form-control form-control-lg" name="identity" autocomplete="username" required autofocus></div><div><div class="d-flex justify-content-between"><label class="form-label">Passwort</label><a href="/forgot" class="small text-decoration-none">Passwort vergessen?</a></div><input class="form-control form-control-lg" type="password" name="password" autocomplete="current-password" required></div><button class="btn btn-primary btn-lg w-100">Anmelden <i class="bi bi-arrow-right ms-1"></i></button></form><div class="security-note"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i><span>Deine Finanzdaten bleiben in deiner eigenen Datenbank.</span></div></div></section></div><%- include('partials/foot-auth') %>
